Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:51:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Object: add example fork operator OBJECT_OT_fork_hello

A minimal C++ operator in its own file, registered with one line in
object_ops.cc, callable as bpy.ops.object.fork_hello(). Serves as the
template for real fork features and as a smoke test of the build loop.
---
